  "final_response": "结论：证毕。\n\n证明过程：\n**证明Shearer熵不等式的特例：**\n\n设$Z=(Z_1,\\dots,Z_d)$为离散随机变量，$H(Z_1,\\dots,Z_d)$为其联合熵，$H(Z_{-i})$表示删去第$i$个坐标后的边缘熵，即$H(Z_1,\\dots,Z_{i-1},Z_{i+1},\\dots,Z_d)$。\n\n由熵的链式法则，对任意$i$，有：\n$$\nH(Z_1,\\dots,Z_d) = H(Z_{-i}) + H(Z_i|Z_{-i}).\n$$\n移项得：\n$$\nH(Z_{-i}) = H(Z_1,\\dots,Z_d) - H(Z_i|Z_{-i}).\n$$\n对$i=1$到$d$求和：\n$$\n\\sum_{i=1}^d H(Z_{-i}) = \\sum_{i=1}^d \\left[ H(Z_1,\\dots,Z_d) - H(Z_i|Z_{-i}) \\right] = d H(Z_1,\\dots,Z_d) - \\sum_{i=1}^d H(Z_i|Z_{-i}).\n$$\n由“条件越多，条件熵越小”的性质，知$H(Z_i|Z_{-i}) \\le H(Z_i)$，故：\n$$\n\\sum_{i=1}^d H(Z_i|Z_{-i}) \\le \\sum_{i=1}^d H(Z_i).\n$$\n又由熵的非负性与链式法则，$H(Z_1,\\dots,Z_d) \\le \\sum_{i=1}^d H(Z_i)$（联合熵不超过边缘熵之和），因此：\n$$\n\\sum_{i=1}^d H(Z_{-i}) \\ge d H(Z_1,\\dots,Z_d) - \\sum_{i=1}^d H(Z_i) \\ge d H(Z_1,\\dots,Z_d) - H(Z_1,\\dots,Z_d) = (d-1) H(Z_1,\\dots,Z_d).\n$$\n即：\n$$\n(d-1)H(Z_1,\\dots,Z_d)\\le\\sum_{i=1}^dH(Z_{-i}).\n$$\n证毕。\n\n**推导离散Loomis--Whitney不等式：**\n\n令$Z$在有限集$A\\subseteq X_1\\times\\cdots\\times X_d$上均匀分布，则：\n$$\nH(Z_1,\\dots,Z_d) = \\log |A|, \\quad H(Z_{-i}) = \\log |\\pi_{-i}(A)|.\n$$\n代入上述Shearer不等式：\n$$\n(d-1)\\log |A| \\le \\sum_{i=1}^d \\log |\\pi_{-i}(A)| = \\log \\left( \\prod_{i=1}^d |\\pi_{-i}(A)| \\right).\n$$\n两边取指数，得：\n$$\n|A|^{d-1} \\le \\prod_{i=1}^d |\\pi_{-i}(A)|.\n$$\n证毕。",
